:        startStates = startKernelIdxs\n1296:let test ex = CompilerLalrParserSpec stdout ex"}], "is_error": false, "command": "grep -n \"ParserSpec\\|startSymbols\\|StartSymbols\\|startspec\\|start\" /Users/ohama/.nuget/packages/fslexyacc/11.3.0/src/fsyacc/fsyaccast.fs | head -30", "exit_code": 0, "timeout": false, "metadata": {"exit_code": 0, "pid": -1, "username": "ohama", "hostname": "ohama", "working_dir": "/Users/ohama/projs/OpenHandsTests/oh-workdir-planning/arm-b/fsharp-r1", "py_interpreter_path": "", "prefix": "", "suffix": "\n[The command completed with exit code 0.]"}, "full_output_save_dir": "/Users/ohama/.openhands/conversations/478f0b7e8faf473ca01e62a74dd5e283/observations", "kind": "TerminalObservation"}, "action_id": "303ca9ec-bdc8-49e3-aada-a9075e157feb", "kind": "ObservationEvent"}
